WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:08.110
Welcome to KiddieTrac. This is your family's home screen, the place everything starts from.

2
00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:15.120
You sign in with the email your centre invited you with, and the password you chose from the invitation link.

3
00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:22.410
The cards at the top show today's status, your balance, new photos, your children, and any open tasks.

4
00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:30.570
Below them is every part of KiddieTrac: your child's day, photos, forms to sign, attendance, health, and more.

5
00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:36.760
And Help and Training are always here, with a guide and a video for every part of the app.

6
00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:45.640
For the best experience, install KiddieTrac on your phone, so you get alerts for messages, photos and invoices even when it's closed.
